Oh, Mathieu, c'est bien improvisé, tu sais.
Oh, Mathieu, this is quite last-minute, you know.

470
00:21:22,140 --> 00:21:23,140
Tu vas voir, c'est très simple.
You'll see, it's very simple.

471
00:21:23,400 --> 00:21:26,200
Je vais te dire un truc. Moi, cette fille, je l'aime beaucoup, beaucoup.
I'll tell you something — I'm very, very fond of this girl.

472
00:21:26,600 --> 00:21:27,900
Ah, mais moi aussi, moi aussi.
Oh, me too, me too.

