C'est ça, l'exclusion contract, pour avoir Isabelle any day, any time.
That's what the exclusivity contract is for — to have Isabelle any day, any time.

514
00:23:33,000 --> 00:23:34,800
Comme ça, pas prévu, toujours prévu.
That way, unplanned is always planned.

515
00:23:34,960 --> 00:23:37,290
Ha ! All right. OK.
Ha! All right. OK.

516
00:23:37,750 --> 00:23:43,190
But, of course, mais ce soir, c'est une soirée très spéciale.
But, of course, tonight is a very special evening.

517
00:23:43,190 --> 00:23:47,990
It's very special because it's le mariage, le wedding de son fils aîné.
It's very special because it's le mariage, the wedding of her eldest son.

518
00:23:48,850 --> 00:23:50,910
