At a time when it wasn't easy to own not wanting children.

1030
00:51:37,060 --> 00:51:37,980
On me regardait de travers.
People looked at me sideways.

1031
00:51:42,430 --> 00:51:43,390
J'ai beaucoup fait la fête.
I partied a lot.

1032
00:51:45,660 --> 00:51:46,220
Beaucoup travaillé.
Worked a lot.

1033
