Vous voyez ça ?
You see that?

1043
00:52:14,300 --> 00:52:15,580
Ça, j'aurais aimé le connaître.
That's something I would have liked to know.

1044
00:52:15,820 --> 00:52:19,220
Un amour qui fait peur aussi.
