1045
00:52:20,130 --> 00:52:21,550
Dis-le, Andrea, dis-le, dis-le.
Say it, Andrea, say it, say it.

1046
00:52:22,010 --> 00:52:22,690
Dis-le à fond.
Say it all the way.

1047
