Un bravo, Gabriel.
A round of applause for Gabriel.

1049
00:52:35,990 --> 00:52:37,930
Tu sais quoi ? Des fois, je me rends compte que je te jure du mal.
You know what? Sometimes I realize I completely underestimate you.

1050
00:52:38,510 --> 00:52:40,570
Ah, mais il a des ressources insoupçonnées, Gabriel.
Oh, but he has unsuspected depths, Gabriel.

1051
00:52:41,170 --> 00:52:41,450
Merci.
Thank you.

1052
00:52:41,870 --> 00:52:42,930
Ben, il se passe quoi, là ?
So, what's going on here?

1053
00:52:42,930 --> 00:52:44,110
