Non, hé, hé, ça te pousse dans tes retranchements ?
No, hey — does it push you to your limits?

1070
00:53:10,930 --> 00:53:11,210
Ouais.
Yeah.

1071
00:53:12,210 --> 00:53:12,490
Ouais.
Yeah.

